flowchart TD
    A[Agent Loop / 领域插件] -->|session.append| E[SessionEvent 事件事实]
    E --> S[Surface：当前模型可见历史]
    S --> M[Message / ContentBlock]
    M --> W[Provider WireMessage]
    E --> F[MuxFrame：事件传输]
    F --> C[ConversationNodeAssembler]
    C --> U[聊天气泡 / 工具卡片 / 轨迹]
    E --> P[SessionProjectionMap：服务端状态投影]
    P --> V[session/projection → UI 状态]
    E --> D[StorageRecord：无损编码]
    D --> J[JSONL / Zstd；SQLite 另有后端]
    J --> R[恢复 Session / 新一轮继续]
    E --> T[SessionTelemetryRecord：筛选 / 复制 / 脱敏]
    T --> O[OTel LogRecord → OTLP/HTTP]
